    - target: {fileID: 3511019140885055024, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "{card}Cards{/card} have powerful effects and may be played during any
        ally\u2019s turn. To use a {card}card{/card}, <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>drag
        it from your hand onto the battlefield</color></font-weight>. If the {card}card{/card}
        is <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>targetable</color></font-weight>, you
        may place it on <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>any valid tile</color></font-weight>,
        depending on its effect, to choose where its effect is applied. \\n\r\n{card}Cards{/card}
        deal {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage} that <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>is
        neither</color></font-weight> {physical_damage}Physical{/physical_damage}
        <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>or</color></font-weight> {elemental_damage}Elemental{/elemental_damage},
        so it is <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>unaffected by effects that increase
        or reduce those</color></font-weight> {physical_damage}damage types{/physical_damage}.
        \\n\r\nYou draw <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>1</color></font-weight> {card}card{/card}
        <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>at the start of every 4 ally character\u2019s
        turns</color></font-weight>, marked in the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Turn
        Order Panel</color></font-weight>. Your hand has a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>maximum
        size of 10</color></font-weight> {card}cards{/card}."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
