    - target: {fileID: 8968194249616649006, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "{mana}Mana{/mana} is a shared resource used to play {card}Cards{/card}
        during combat. {mana}Mana{/mana} is gained passively at the start of <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>every
        ally character\u2019s turn</color></font-weight>, and can also be generated
        by {ability}abilities{/ability} or {card}card{/card} effects.\\n\r\nPlaying
        a {card}card{/card} consumes {mana}Mana{/mana}. If you lack sufficient {mana}Mana{/mana},
        the {card}card{/card} cannot be used. The {mana}Mana cost{/mana} shown on
        a {card}card{/card} provides immediate feedback:\r\n \u2022 If the cost is
        shown in <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>red</color></font-weight>, you <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>cannot
        afford</color></font-weight> to play the {card}card{/card}.\r\n \u2022 If
        the cost is shown in <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>green</color></font-weight>,
        the {card}card\u2019s cost{/card} has been <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>reduced</color></font-weight>
        by the effect of other {card}cards{/card}, {ability}abilities{/ability},
        or traits."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
